 {'Domain':'Sleep / caffeine','Core_Status':'SUPPORTING','International_Role':'Bounded supporting section only','Brazil_Role':'Not used','Claims':'RC-INT-SLEEP-01','Evidence_Density':'1 systematic review/meta-analysis','Decision':'KEEP_INTERNATIONAL_ONLY'},
